<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document>
<name>Cherry blossom paths (Seoul)</name>
<description><![CDATA[Four cherry-blossom walks. Peak bloom is usually the first two weeks of April. Main path: Sindorim Station exit 6 along the Dorimcheon stream to Dorimcheon Station, then the Anyangcheon embankment from Sinjeong Bridge to Gocheok Bridge. Plus Yeouido Yunjung-ro, the Seokchon Lake loop and the Namsan North Loop.]]></description>
